Relationship to LLaVA
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is NOT a redistribution of LLaVA. It contains only the files
that this work adds to, or modifies in, an existing LLaVA-1.5 checkout:

  ADDED (written by the authors of this repository)
    llava/model/dual_stream/__init__.py
    llava/model/dual_stream/cross_anchor_attention.py
    llava/model/dual_stream/perception_contrast.py
    llava/model/dual_stream/roi_utils.py
    llava/model/dual_stream/text_encoder.py
    llava/model/dual_stream/image_utils.py
    prepare_v5_data.py,
    train_full_v6.py, train_ablation_v6.py, setup_ablation_configs.py,
    verify_fixes.py, check_v6_wandb_drift.py,
    generate_captions.py, eval_chair_official.py, eval_chair.py, eval_pope.py,
    eval_mirage.py, eval_mme_hallucination.py, eval_hallusion.py,
    eval_mmhal.py, auto_judge_dualstream.py,
    run_ca_v6_percfix_then_shutdown.sh

  MODIFIED (derived from LLaVA, Copyright 2023 Haotian Liu et al.,
            licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0)
    llava/model/language_model/llava_llama.py
      - imports the dual_stream modules
      - adds init_dual_stream_modules() to (re)initialise the added modules
        after from_pretrained()
      - registers the cross-attention injection at the cognition layers
      - adds the perception-stream InfoNCE loss term to the training forward
      - adds the ablation switches disable_cross_anchor / disable_perception_loss

  UNMODIFIED upstream LLaVA files are deliberately NOT included here. Obtain
  them from https://github.com/haotian-liu/LLaVA (v1.5) and copy the files of
  this repository over that checkout, as described in README.md.

